 billions place:**\n    \\[\n    0 + 0 + 1 (\\text{carried}) = 1\n    \\]\n\nCombining all the results, we get the final sum:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1,\\!624,\\!840,\\!318}\n\\].Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
