s place:**\n   \\[\n   2 + 6 = 8 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 8)\n   \\]\n   \n9. **Add the hundred-millions place:**\n   \\[\n   1 + 9 = 10 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 10)\n   \\]\n\nCombining all the results, we get the final sum:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1,\\!089,\\!742,\\!623}\n\\].Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
